        <mn>111111</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle 111111}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/987d77c58b2edbc31d4bee8c35c3da7fcd0004fc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:6.975ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle 111111}"/></span>) equals the sum of columns 1, 4, and 5.</p>

<p id="mwRg">This matrix is also not <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt17" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\overline{2}"}}' id="mwRw"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle {\overline {2}}}">
