  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/2a6386c04cc8dc392ec80390cb0e4cfdbecae8d2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:9.998ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \Theta (d^{2}\ln n)}"/></span> rows.<sup about="#mwt45" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Porat2008_5-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Porat2008"}}'><a href="./Disjunct_matrix#cite_note-Porat2008-5" id="mwyA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwyQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwyg">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwyw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

